    "updated_at": "2026-02-16T14:24:59Z",
    "body": "Was also one of my thoughts. I tried replacing them with 1e-5, but that didnt help.\n\nP.S. My main need is to convert the outcome of expressions like a <= b to boolean. I do this by checking whether b - a <= epsilon or b - a >= 1.1 * epsilon. Let me know if there is a better approch :-)",
